codex-app-server-0.166.0.contract.json

This file is cut down from the JSON schema of the Codex app-server protocol that OpenAI Codex
(https://github.com/openai/codex), version 0.166.0 (release tag rust-v0.166.0, installed as
codex-cli 0.166.0), generates with:

    codex app-server generate-json-schema --out <folder>

It keeps only the four message unions (method names and parameter references) and the shape of the
definitions the contract tests in crates/agents/tests/codex.rs read (property names, required
fields, type tags). Every description and every other definition was left out. It is regenerated
and cut again for each Codex version Archforge is tested with.

